<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>You're now managing {{teamName}}</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; background: #f6f8fa; }
    .card { background: #ffffff; padding: 28px 32px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); }
    .header { color: #2c3e50; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 12px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .header h2 { margin: 0; }
    .meta { background: #f1f5f9; padding: 16px 18px; border-left: 4px solid #3498db; border-radius: 4px; margin: 18px 0; font-size: 14px; }
    .meta div { margin: 4px 0; }
    .meta strong { color: #111; }
    .steps { padding-left: 22px; }
    .steps li { margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .button { background: #3498db; color: #ffffff !important; padding: 12px 22px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block; margin: 18px 0; font-weight: 600; }
    .footer { margin-top: 24px; font-size: 12px; color: #777; border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding-top: 12px; text-align: center; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="header">
      <h2>You're now managing {{teamName}}</h2>
    </div>

    <p>Hi {{managerName}},</p>
    <p>You have been assigned as the manager of <strong>{{teamName}}</strong> on {{appName}}. As a manager, you can view your team's data, create assignments for them, and review their submissions.</p>

    <div class="meta">
      <div><strong>Team:</strong> {{teamName}}</div>
      {{#if memberCount}}<div><strong>Members:</strong> {{memberCount}}</div>{{/if}}
      {{#if organizationName}}<div><strong>Organization:</strong> {{organizationName}}</div>{{/if}}
    </div>

    <p><strong>What you can do:</strong></p>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li>View team members and their progress.</li>
      <li>Create assignments for your team (document or assessment-based).</li>
      <li>Review and provide feedback on submissions.</li>
      <li>Receive escalation alerts when team members miss deadlines.</li>
    </ol>

    <p style="text-align:center;">
      <a href="{{managerUrl}}" class="button">Open Manager Dashboard</a>
    </p>

    <p>If you have any questions, contact us at <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}">{{supportEmail}}</a>.</p>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>&copy; {{year}} {{appName}}. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
